{"ticker":"HSIC","updated":"2026-10-30T22:52:36Z","profile":{"longName":"Henry Schein, Inc.","shortName":"Henry Schein, Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Distribution","country":"United States","website":"https://www.henryschein.com","fullTimeEmployees":25000,"marketCap":9459581952,"trailingPE":24.746355,"forwardPE":14.1696205,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.69545525,"pegRatio":1.72,"targetMeanPrice":96.86667,"targetHighPrice":110.0,"targetLowPrice":64.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.067,"earningsGrowth":0.171,"grossMargins":0.31319,"operatingMargins":0.057550002,"profitMargins":0.02963,"totalRevenue":13601999872,"beta":0.843,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":92.18,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":62.44,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Henry Schein, Inc. provides health care products and services to office-based dental and medical practitioners worldwide. It operates through Global Distribution and Value-Added Services; Global Specialty Products; and Global Technology segments. The Global Distribution and Value-Added Services segment distributes infection-control products, handpieces, preventatives, impression materials, composites, anesthetics, teeth, gypsum, acrylics, articulators, abrasives, PPE products, branded and generic pharmaceuticals, vaccines, surgical products, diagnostic tests, dental chairs, delivery units and lights, digital dental laboratories, X-ray supplies and equipment, and high-tech and digital restoration equipment, as well as provides equipment repair services, financial services on a non-recourse basis, continuing education services for practitioners, consulting, and other services. It also markets and sells a portfolio of consumable merchandise under its own corporate brand. The Global Specialty Products segment engage in manufacturing, marketing, and sales of dental implant and biomaterial products; and endodontic, orthodontic and orthopedic products, and other health care-related products and services. The Global Technology segment is involved in the development and distribution of practice management software, e-services, and other products which are distributed to health care prov","summary_zh":"Henry Schein, Inc. 為全球牙科和醫療從業人員提供醫療保健產品和服務。它透過全球分銷和增值服務運作；全球特色產品；和全球技術部門。全球分銷和增值服務部門分銷感染控制產品、手機、預防劑、印模材料、複合材料、麻醉劑、牙齒、石膏、丙烯酸樹脂、咬合器、磨料、個人防護用品、品牌和非專利藥品、疫苗、外科產品、診斷測試、牙科椅、分娩裝置和燈、數位牙科實驗室、X射線用品和設備以及高科技和數位用品設備，並提供無維修服務、金融服務和其他服務。它還以自己的企業品牌行銷和銷售一系列消費品。全球特種產品部門從事植牙和生物材料產品的製造、行銷和銷售；牙髓、正畸和矯形產品，以及其他醫療保健相關產品和服務。全球技術部門參與實踐管理軟體、電子服務和其他產品的開發和分銷，這些產品分發給醫療保健提供者","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療配送","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":69.22,"h":69.57,"l":68.25,"c":68.39,"v":1046200},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":68.38,"h":68.81,"l":66.69,"c":67.13,"v":1482000},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":67.12,"h":68.13,"l":66.61,"c":67.78,"v":1316300},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":67.79,"h":69.59,"l":67.51,"c":69.43,"v":1360700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":69.48,"h":69.66,"l":67.0,"c":67.74,"v":1546800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":67.5,"h":67.94,"l":66.98,"c":67.65,"v":1173600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":68.47,"h":70.69,"l":67.12,"c":67.41,"v":1939700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":67.41,"h":69.89,"l":67.22,"c":69.55,"v":1328900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":69.36,"h":69.82,"l":68.54,"c":69.01,"v":1115000},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":68.94,"h":69.28,"l":68.43,"c":68.81,"v":1504500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":69.03,"h":69.11,"l":67.9,"c":68.39,"v":1258100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":68.44,"h":69.0,"l":67.1,"c":67.37,"v":1569100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":67.32,"h":68.9,"l":66.96,"c":68.55,"v":1391300},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":68.74,"h":68.99,"l":67.78,"c":67.86,"v":5625800},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":67.91,"h":68.22,"l":67.5,"c":67.92,"v":1499800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":68.13,"h":69.58,"l":68.0,"c":69.21,"v":1181400},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":68.91,"h":69.38,"l":67.71,"c":67.75,"v":1005400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":67.02,"h":67.07,"l":65.4,"c":65.64,"v":1207100},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":65.73,"h":66.39,"l":65.43,"c":66.06,"v":1030800},{"t":"2025-09-29","